        {
          "id": "SP_NEITHEA_REGULARIS",
          "name": "Neithea regularis",
          "rank": "SPECIES",
          "commonName": "",
          "lineage": "Neithea",
          "subspeciesCount": 0,
          "description": "Measurements UPMC. PAL 2017.0.17, DVL: 57 mm; APL: 45 mm. SU. PAL. 2017.0.13.297, DVL (umbonal part incomplete): 28 mm, APL: 34 mm. Description Right valve convex, equilateral. Umbonal angle 80 °. Trace of around 20 distinct low ribs, probably more (25 – 30). Parts of preserved shell showing smooth ribs. Left valve flattened with 26 ribs. Ribs narrow. Intercalary ribs undistinguishable.",
          "sourcedFrom": "gbif",
